  "description": "Modern-day culinary genius Ji-Yeong suddenly finds herself transported back to the Joseon Dynasty, trapped in the royal kitchens of the most notorious tyrant in history. To keep her head on her shoulders, she must satisfy the volatile cravings of King Yeon-San-- a man whose legendary temper is as sharp as the chef’s own knives. With political rivals plotting her downfall and a mad king watching her every move, can Ji-Yeong’s 21st-century recipes serve as her ultimate shield, or will her next meal be her last?\n\n(Source: WEBTOON)",
